('127.888.d.31.B',3,'A mechanic follows the manual to drain old water, disinfect and fill the potable water tank. She is:','["locating and explaining the procedures for servicing a potable water system", "painting the tank", "ignoring the manual", "guessing"]'::jsonb,0,'Water service data.','original'),
